    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Impact of AI-Triage on Radiologist Report Turnaround Time: Real-<span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> Time-Savings and Insights from <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Predictions
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Thompson%2C+Y+L+E">Yee Lam Elim Thompson</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fergus%2C+J">Jonathan Fergus</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chung%2C+J">Jonathan Chung</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Delfino%2C+J+G">Jana G. Delfino</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+W">Weijie Chen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Levine%2C+G+M">Gary M. Levine</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Samuelson%2C+F+W">Frank W. Samuelson</a>
      
