    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Efficient Parallel Samplers for Recurrent-Depth <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> and Their Connection to <span class="search-hit mathjax">Diffusion</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
