    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Watermarking for Factuality: Guiding <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> Toward Truth via Tri-layer Contrastive Decoding
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Back%2C+K">Kyungryul Back</a>, 
      
