        InternVLA-M1: A Spatially Guided <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span>-Action Framework for Generalist Robot Policy
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+X">Xinyi Chen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+Y">Yilun Chen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fu%2C+Y">Yanwei Fu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gao%2C+N">Ning Gao</a>, 
      
